   "date": "2026-11-05T06:31:15Z",
   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-437: no pages before our hourly record, one range toggle everywhere (#790)\n\n* SEB-437: no pages before our hourly record, one range toggle everywhere\n\nEvents lists only events from our own hourly record. Older breaks are one table in Research (research-breaks.html), reached from the Research list and from the home block. event.html?id= before the record redirects to the table, index.html?day= before it opens home's default view. One range component (js/range_toggle.js) for home, routes and country charts, replacing Show earlier days and the Now/Year picker. Routes chart Month axis: a young record no longer dates its gaps with a negative offset. DESIGN.md rule and tools/check_event_pages.py. New words ship as empty slots (docs/copy-slots/research-breaks.md); the writer PR follows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* SEB-437: inventory baseline, the earlier-days button and year picker are gone on purpose\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* SEB-437: the bake leaves out a page whose headline words are not in yet\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Sebastian Roervig <sebastian.roervig@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
  },
